Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.87,Default,,60,60,0,,Imagine an animal\Nthat can shatter an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:05.74,Default,,60,60,0,,aquarium with a\Nsingle punch. Meet the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.61,Default,,60,60,0,,Mantis Shrimp, a small\Nbut terrifying crustacean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:11.48,Default,,60,60,0,,from the ocean's\Ntropical reefs. Its club-like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:14.35,Default,,60,60,0,,appendages accelerate\Nfaster than a .22 caliber
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:17.22,Default,,60,60,0,,bullet, reaching\N50 miles per hour in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:20.09,Default,,60,60,0,,just 3 milliseconds.\NThis isn't just a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:22.96,Default,,60,60,0,,hit; it creates a\Nsuperheated cavitation bubble
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.83,Default,,60,60,0,,that instantly vaporizes water,\Ngenerating immense shockwaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:28.70,Default,,60,60,0,,It's so powerful\Nit can boil water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.57,Default,,60,60,0,,and generate light,\Npulverizing crab shells and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:34.44,Default,,60,60,0,,even small fish. But\Nits arsenal doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.31,Default,,60,60,0,,stop there. Mantis\Nshrimp also possess the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:40.18,Default,,60,60,0,,most complex eyes\Nin the entire animal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.18,0:00:43.05,Default,,60,60,0,,kingdom, seeing up\Nto 16 primary colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.05,0:00:45.92,Default,,60,60,0,,far beyond our\Nmeasly three. They can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:48.79,Default,,60,60,0,,even detect polarized\Nlight. Is this creature
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:50.43,Default,,60,60,0,,more alien than animal?